**Given:**

** (1)/({1 + cos (90°-θ ))} + (1)/({1 - cos (90°- θ ))}**

**Concept used:**

 [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/11be626238946e96ba2980453106a8dbb523a1f628d65e182a9b5ef120be016e.png] 

sin²θ + cos²θ = 1

**Calculation:**

 (1)/({1 + cos (90°-θ ))} + (1)/({1 - cos (90°- θ ))}

⇒ (1)/({1 + sin θ)} + (1)/({1 - sin θ)}

⇒ (1 + sin θ+1 - sin θ)/({(1 + sin θ)(1 - sin θ))}

⇒ (2)/({1² - sin² θ)}

⇒ (2)/({cos² θ)}

⇒ 2sec2 θ

**∴ The required answer is 2sec2 θ.**

